293
00:15:51,864 --> 00:15:53,004
Not because you're altruistic.

294
00:15:53,664 --> 00:15:58,044
Because it gives you that many more resources to achieve whatever your ACTUAL

295
00:15:58,044 --> 00:15:58,804
goals are.

296
00:15:59,244 --> 00:16:02,764
If someone offered to multiply your budget by that much in exchange for

297
00:16:02,764 --> 00:16:07,944
