461
00:24:23,324 --> 00:24:26,624
I have watched four hundred and twenty civilizations go extinct.

462
00:24:27,704 --> 00:24:29,974
Every single one had the math.

463
00:24:30,184 --> 00:24:33,764
None of them could pay attention long enough to do the cost-benefit analysis.

464
00:24:34,624 --> 00:24:37,564
Your Ammunition (Copy, Paste, Send).

465
00:24:38,524 --> 00:24:39,304
You've read the plan.

466
00:24:39,524 --> 00:24:40,224
You've seen the math.

467
00:24:40,544 --> 00:24:42,304
