479
00:25:17,384 --> 00:25:21,004
Forwarding dominates not-forwarding in every scenario.

480
00:25:21,504 --> 00:25:22,314
This is not an opinion.

481
00:25:23,064 --> 00:25:24,554
It's a payoff matrix.

482
00:25:24,904 --> 00:25:28,784
On Wishonia, choosing option three or four when option one costs thirty

483
00:25:28,784 --> 00:25:32,884
seconds would not happen, because it doesn't make sense, and on Wishonia

484
00:25:32,884 --> 00:25:34,744
