00:25:40,704 --> 00:25:43,284
The payoff matrix above is denominated in lives.

488
00:25:44,024 --> 00:25:46,424
Your species has difficulty acting on lives.

489
00:25:47,204 --> 00:25:51,584
(You tolerate ten point seven billion preventable deaths right now, and

