491
00:25:55,324 --> 00:25:59,484
So here is the same calculation in the unit that actually moves humans.

492
00:26:00,144 --> 00:26:03,824
Even just the treaty path alone (redirect the murder budget, fix nothing

493
00:26:03,824 --> 00:26:08,604
else) produces an economy sixteen point five times larger than the baseline

494
00:26:08,604 --> 00:26:09,564
