499
00:26:21,024 --> 00:26:24,764
Over an average remaining lifespan, your cumulative earnings under the treaty

500
00:26:24,764 --> 00:26:29,224
path would be thirteen point five times what they'd be on the current trajectory.

501
00:26:29,704 --> 00:26:33,824
For the average human, the gain is fourteen point nine million dollars in

