506
00:26:45,004 --> 00:26:48,524
The opportunity cost of not forwarding is not "thirty seconds."

507
00:26:48,864 --> 00:26:53,524
It is fourteen point nine million dollars in foregone lifetime income for

508
00:26:53,524 --> 00:26:57,864
the average person, compounding over forty-eight point five remaining years.

509
00:26:58,664 --> 00:27:02,364
Each year the treaty hasn't started is a year the twenty-year compounding

510
00:27:02,364 --> 00:27:03,404
